WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.400
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

02:07.140 --> 02:08.770
Knock it off!

02:11.110 --> 02:13.110
Yashiro?

02:15.150 --> 02:17.150
Chiaki's fiancée?!

02:18.450 --> 02:21.870
Oh, you girls are from Momokuri Academy...

02:21.870 --> 02:23.080
You know each other?

02:23.080 --> 02:24.620
Yes.

02:25.540 --> 02:28.330
I'm looking forward to the tournament tomorrow.

02:30.250 --> 02:34.210
So am I. We won't lose against Biwa High School...especially you!

02:34.210 --> 02:37.300
You're Kusakabe-san, right?

02:37.300 --> 02:40.390
I cannot lose against you.

02:41.970 --> 02:48.270
Chiaki-san talks about you a lot, so I made up my mind not to lose to you...

02:48.270 --> 02:50.770
...in either rhythmic gymnastics or love.

03:08.080 --> 03:10.040
Yashiro, why are you here?

03:10.040 --> 03:15.380
Your father asked me to prepare a home-cooked meal for you.

03:15.380 --> 03:17.210
My old man? Get real.

03:17.210 --> 03:23.590
No, it's true. I'll not only take care of your food, but cleaning and laundry as well.

03:23.590 --> 03:27.970
No! You can't! Don't even think about being alone together!

03:27.970 --> 03:30.480
Why are you bringing her to my place?

03:30.480 --> 03:35.860
Until Chiaki-san is satisfied, I, Sazanka Yashiro, cannot return home!

03:35.860 --> 03:37.940
I made a promise to his father.

03:37.940 --> 03:40.280
Lies! Those are the eyes of a liar!

03:40.280 --> 03:43.950
Can you please refrain yourself from interfering in our affairs?

03:43.950 --> 03:45.240
What was that?!

03:51.210 --> 03:56.170
All right, everything will be okay if you guys use my kitchen, right?

03:56.500 --> 04:03.180
The Medal of Friendship Possessed by the Demon

04:07.310 --> 04:09.970
You said you were asked to to this...

04:09.970 --> 04:12.020
You don't believe me, do you?

04:12.020 --> 04:14.690
Where is Chiaki's dad, anyway?

04:14.690 --> 04:17.110
Why don't they live together?

04:17.110 --> 04:18.940
Oh, you don't know?

04:18.940 --> 04:20.780
That's why I'm asking!

04:20.780 --> 04:24.700
He's never talked about his family, has he, Maron?

04:24.700 --> 04:25.530
Yeah...

04:25.530 --> 04:28.490
Then it isn't my place to tell you, either.

04:28.490 --> 04:31.250
It's his business, after all.

04:32.830 --> 04:37.670
I've got it! You don't know anything either, do you?

04:37.670 --> 04:41.050
So much for "fiancée."

04:41.050 --> 04:42.590
Cut it out, you two.

04:42.590 --> 04:45.680
It's not my fault. Toudaiji-san is the one making a big deal out of this.

04:45.680 --> 04:49.760
Then, why don't you tell us about Chiaki? Why is he living alone?

04:49.760 --> 04:53.940
Stop it! There's no point talking about him behind his back.

04:53.940 --> 04:57.270
There may be things he doesn't want to talk abo--

04:57.270 --> 05:03.570
I mean, in the first place there are circumstances that we don't know about, so what's the point in talking about it?

05:03.570 --> 05:05.700
- What about me?

05:12.080 --> 05:13.750
There was something I wanted to do.

05:13.750 --> 05:14.910
What?

05:14.910 --> 05:17.210
The reason I left home.

05:24.220 --> 05:28.220
Hey Chiaki, you said you had something to do...

05:28.220 --> 05:30.140
Huh? Yeah...

05:30.140 --> 05:32.140
Then, that's...

05:32.140 --> 05:34.980
What is it? Could you tell me?

05:36.190 --> 05:37.440
You want to know?

05:41.070 --> 05:42.320
I won't tell you!

05:43.860 --> 05:46.780
He really looks like he wants to tell us.

05:46.780 --> 05:49.660
Then, I'll just tell Maron my secrets.

05:49.660 --> 05:53.120
No, thanks. Keeping other people's secrets is too much responsibility.

05:53.120 --> 05:55.830
That's because your own secrets are enough.

05:55.830 --> 05:57.830
Just kidding!

06:12.310 --> 06:16.060
Yashiro is such a conniving girl!

06:17.180 --> 06:20.020
Move your hands and not your mouth.

06:23.730 --> 06:28.030
Hey Maron, who do you think Chiaki likes?

06:29.950 --> 06:31.990
I think he likes everyone.

06:31.990 --> 06:34.700
Nah, can't be. It's just an act.

06:34.700 --> 06:35.790
You think so?

06:35.790 --> 06:41.500
He's nice to everyone, but it seems like an empty kindness.

06:42.540 --> 06:45.840
I think Chiaki likes you, Maron.

06:45.840 --> 06:47.210
What?

06:48.170 --> 06:51.390
Chiaki is always looking at you...

06:51.390 --> 06:52.850
Haven't you noticed?

06:52.850 --> 06:57.140
Wait a second, Miyako! Don't say weird things like that!

06:57.140 --> 07:00.900
How do you feel about Chiaki?

07:00.900 --> 07:02.230
He's a classmate...

07:02.230 --> 07:03.440
And that's it?

07:03.440 --> 07:04.980
My next door neighbor.

07:04.980 --> 07:07.490
That's not the point of my questions!

07:09.610 --> 07:13.530
He does act recklessly at times...

07:13.530 --> 07:17.370
...but I'm starting to think that he's not such a bad guy, after all.

07:17.370 --> 07:20.210
That's it? Is that all you feel about Chiaki?

07:20.210 --> 07:23.540
What do you mean by "that's it?"

07:29.130 --> 07:29.920
I see...

07:31.300 --> 07:35.100
Maybe people can't see what's right under their nose.

07:35.100 --> 07:36.140
Huh?

07:36.140 --> 07:38.140
Good night.

07:43.980 --> 07:45.610
Miyako...

07:58.120 --> 07:59.000
Please!

07:59.000 --> 08:01.910
It'd be fine if there was a Demon, but...

08:01.910 --> 08:03.420
Just for a little bit!

08:03.420 --> 08:07.000
But that's just like spying, right?

08:08.000 --> 08:12.380
I know, but... There was something wrong with Miyako.

08:15.010 --> 08:16.430
I gotcha.

08:16.430 --> 08:19.180
But I'm only going for a little bit.

08:32.400 --> 08:34.320
Maron...

08:37.700 --> 08:41.750
<i>Come back, you cheaters!</i>

08:45.330 --> 08:49.460
<i>Oh, well. Hey, girls...</i>

08:53.670 --> 08:57.140
<i>Was it okay for us to ditch Miyako-chan?</i>

08:57.140 --> 08:59.850
<i>But she's so annoying, ordering us around and stuff.</i>

08:59.850 --> 09:03.810
<i>Yeah, yeah. She told us to shut up when we were just having fun.</i>

09:03.810 --> 09:05.810
<i>What''s wrong with her?</i>

09:12.190 --> 09:13.820
<i>Miyako!</i>

09:13.820 --> 09:16.410
<i>What, Maron? What do you want?</i>

09:19.240 --> 09:21.490
<i>Let's go home together!</i>

09:26.250 --> 09:34.220
<i>I think it makes others feel bad when I tell them to be quiet or not to run.</i>

09:34.970 --> 09:41.810
<i>But someone has to say it, even though I don't like being the bad guy.</i>

09:41.810 --> 09:44.680
<i>I know that people have a hard time understanding me.</i>

09:44.680 --> 09:45.980
<i>I understand you.</i>

09:45.980 --> 09:46.940
<i>What?</i>

09:46.940 --> 09:49.770
<i>Because I'm always watching over you, Miyako.</i>

09:51.440 --> 09:54.320
<i>Oh, really...</i>

09:58.410 --> 10:00.200
<i>What's this?</i>

10:00.200 --> 10:04.790
<i>I give you this medal for all your hard work.</i>

10:04.790 --> 10:07.750
<i>Congratulations, Toudaiji Miyako-san!</i>

10:07.750 --> 10:11.040
<i>Way to go, Miyako! You're great!</i>

10:11.040 --> 10:12.750
<i>It's ugly...</i>

10:12.750 --> 10:16.050
<i>Please be yourself all the time, forever!</i>

10:16.050 --> 10:17.760
<i>It's heavy...</i>

10:17.760 --> 10:20.510
<i>Let's stay together forever, okay?</i>

10:31.730 --> 10:34.190
<i>You never change...</i>

10:44.700 --> 10:46.750
Oh, no! Miyako-chan!

10:46.750 --> 10:48.710
I have to tell Maron!

10:53.630 --> 10:57.510
What's wrong, Miyako? What was that noise?

10:57.510 --> 10:59.090
Miyako?!

11:00.300 --> 11:02.970
Notice

11:00.300 --> 11:02.970
Don't go away!

11:00.300 --> 11:02.970
I'll return right after these messages!

11:00.300 --> 11:02.970
Kaitou Jeanne

11:03.890 --> 11:06.470
Notice

11:03.890 --> 11:06.470
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:03.890 --> 11:06.470
Kaitou Jeanne

11:06.890 --> 11:08.140
Sleeping?

11:08.140 --> 11:11.190
She's probably tired or something.

11:11.190 --> 11:14.230
She doesn't have a fever, but she's sleeping and won't wake up.

11:14.230 --> 11:16.030
Tired...?

11:16.030 --> 11:18.650
She'll be okay. Don't you have to go to school?

11:19.650 --> 11:21.610
Bye.

11:21.610 --> 11:25.370
I wonder if she'll be on time.

11:26.200 --> 11:30.960
Wow... Miyako's absent? Will wonders ever cease?

11:30.960 --> 11:32.880
It's gonna rain. Maybe even snow.

11:32.880 --> 11:35.170
I know you're joking but don't say stuff like that.

11:35.170 --> 11:38.050
Why not? You're too easy on Miyako.

11:38.050 --> 11:41.380
It's not a matter of going too easy or hard on her.

11:41.380 --> 11:42.470
But, it's nice once in a while...

11:42.470 --> 11:43.760
What is?

11:43.760 --> 11:46.850
Because Miyako was sick, we ended up being late together.

11:46.850 --> 11:50.770
What's so nice about that? We're out here because of that.

11:50.770 --> 11:52.850
We can be alone together.

11:52.850 --> 11:54.900
I can stare at your face.

11:57.190 --> 12:00.190
You were with Yashiro-san last night...

12:00.190 --> 12:02.570
I just took her home, that's all.

12:02.570 --> 12:04.320
Yeah, whatever.

12:04.320 --> 12:07.990
I can only think about you, Maron.

12:07.990 --> 12:09.450
- And...

12:08.490 --> 12:09.450
- Stop it!

12:10.120 --> 12:12.120
What's going on?

12:12.120 --> 12:14.040
Kusakabe, what's going on here?

12:14.040 --> 12:17.340
It was my fault. I told her a lame joke.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.420
Is that all?

12:19.420 --> 12:21.130
Yes.

12:23.300 --> 12:25.090
Kusakabe, get back inside the classroom.

12:25.090 --> 12:27.640
Nagoya, you stand here until class ends.

12:27.640 --> 12:29.680
Come to the staff room after school.

12:29.680 --> 12:30.600
- Yes, ma'am!

12:29.680 --> 12:30.600
- But...!

12:30.600 --> 12:32.770
End of discussion!

12:56.710 --> 13:00.670
<i>I'm hurt... because of Chiaki.</i>

13:02.090 --> 13:07.550
<i>Not from him joking around...</i>

13:07.550 --> 13:12.220
<i>...but because he laughed it off as a lame joke later.</i>

13:12.220 --> 13:15.600
<i>Would it have been better if I'd been for real?</i>

13:15.600 --> 13:18.310
<i>No, I don't know...</i>

13:18.310 --> 13:20.980
<i>I want to talk to Miyako...</i>

13:24.950 --> 13:29.660
<i>But what am I going to say to her?</i>

13:31.410 --> 13:32.910
You may go now.

13:32.910 --> 13:34.870
Don't let it happen again.

13:34.870 --> 13:37.290
Yes. I'm really sorry.

13:45.130 --> 13:46.510
Maron?

13:46.510 --> 13:48.680
I wanted to apologize.

13:48.680 --> 13:51.310
You waited here this long just to say that?

13:51.310 --> 13:54.560
You were standing in the hallway a lot longer.

13:54.560 --> 13:56.310
That was my fault.

13:56.310 --> 13:58.770
No, it's because I yelled out.

14:00.270 --> 14:02.230
- Anyway...

14:00.270 --> 14:02.230
- And...

14:04.650 --> 14:07.150
We don't mesh too well.

14:07.150 --> 14:09.450
No, it's the opposite. We mesh too well.

14:09.450 --> 14:12.120
Whichever you say, we still clash.

14:12.120 --> 14:13.620
Yeah...

14:13.620 --> 14:15.000
Good afternoon.

14:16.330 --> 14:18.960
I came to thank you for yesterday.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.420
Yesterday?

14:20.420 --> 14:23.170
You took me home...

14:23.880 --> 14:27.420
You don't mind if I take Chiaki?

14:28.220 --> 14:30.430
You don't have to ask me...

14:38.310 --> 14:41.110
Miyako, Maron-chan's here. Miyako...

14:41.110 --> 14:42.480
I'll go get some tea for you...

14:42.480 --> 14:44.360
Please, don't bother...

14:48.780 --> 14:50.950
<i>The Petit Claire...</i>

14:50.950 --> 14:52.990
<i>It's reacting...</i>

14:52.990 --> 14:55.910
No way... It can't be...

14:56.830 --> 14:58.160
<i>Why...?</i>

14:58.160 --> 15:02.210
<i>Why is the Demon possessing Miyako? I won't forgive it!</i>

15:02.210 --> 15:04.250
Fin, where you? Fin!

15:04.250 --> 15:06.920
Maron!

15:06.920 --> 15:09.010
Fin, where were you?

15:09.010 --> 15:10.590
We have to <i>Checkmate</i> it quickly!

15:10.590 --> 15:12.470
I'm worried about Miyako-chan's body!

15:12.470 --> 15:14.260
Yeah. What's the target?

15:16.270 --> 15:18.980
It can't be. The papier mâché medal?

15:18.980 --> 15:20.230
Yeah...

15:20.230 --> 15:22.270
No...

15:22.270 --> 15:24.730
What is it, Maron?

15:25.900 --> 15:28.320
I made it.

15:28.320 --> 15:30.490
I made it and gave it to Miyako.

15:30.490 --> 15:31.660
What?

15:33.370 --> 15:37.080
I thought I was the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc...

15:37.080 --> 15:40.330
I thought God was protecting me!

15:40.330 --> 15:44.290
Why is Miyako suffering because of something I made?

15:44.290 --> 15:45.880
Why?

15:48.050 --> 15:52.010
It's because a beautiful heart put so much into it.

15:53.340 --> 15:58.770
A beautiful heart is a source of power, for both God and the Devil.

15:58.770 --> 16:02.100
So there's no need to feel bad.

16:03.850 --> 16:09.230
What you have to do is to <i>Checkmate</i> it as soon as possible, understand?

16:22.330 --> 16:23.120
Ready?

16:31.510 --> 16:34.590
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

16:44.980 --> 16:46.770
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:46.770 --> 16:48.690
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:48.690 --> 16:50.530
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:55.280 --> 16:55.950
She's gone.

16:55.950 --> 16:57.490
Find her, Jeanne!

16:57.490 --> 16:59.740
But where?

16:59.740 --> 17:05.330
There might be a hint in your memories of the medal.

17:05.330 --> 17:07.330
Memories...

17:14.680 --> 17:18.260
- Chiaki-san, you take two spoons of sugar, right?

17:16.930 --> 17:18.260
- No.

17:19.810 --> 17:25.230
Did I do something to make you upset?

17:25.230 --> 17:27.940
It's not that, but...

17:28.520 --> 17:30.270
But what?

17:34.530 --> 17:36.240
I'm sorry, Yashiro...

17:37.200 --> 17:40.950
Chiaki-san, wait please!

17:40.990 --> 17:44.450
You know how I feel about you.

17:46.500 --> 17:48.630
I'm sorry...

17:48.630 --> 17:50.960
Is there someone else you like?

17:52.500 --> 17:54.210
There is, right?

17:54.210 --> 17:56.930
I don't know if I like her.

17:56.930 --> 18:00.760
But I do feel like I want to look at her all the time.

18:00.760 --> 18:02.180
All the time...

18:11.480 --> 18:13.110
I found her.

18:13.110 --> 18:15.650
Get out of the medal! Now!

18:23.120 --> 18:23.740
Miyako!

18:29.120 --> 18:31.130
Give Miyako back!

18:31.130 --> 18:33.130
<i>I will not!</i>

18:33.130 --> 18:35.460
<i>I will take this human's heart.</i>

18:35.460 --> 18:39.300
<i>If you interfere, I will kill you!</i>

18:50.060 --> 18:51.400
Miyako!

18:51.400 --> 18:54.360
<i>A human's body is too weak.</i>

18:55.280 --> 18:57.320
I won't forgive this!

19:03.780 --> 19:05.910
In the name of God...

19:08.290 --> 19:11.210
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

19:12.040 --> 19:14.380
I seal you here!

19:15.050 --> 19:17.170
<i>Do it if you can!</i>

19:20.090 --> 19:21.340
Miyako!

19:21.340 --> 19:25.390
<i>The instant you throw the pin, my nails will slit her throat.</i>

19:48.950 --> 19:51.460
Mi...

19:50.580 --> 19:51.460
yako...

19:52.250 --> 19:53.920
<i>It's over, Jeanne.</i>

20:00.130 --> 20:02.220
I'm so sorry, Miyako...

20:02.220 --> 20:05.470
Because I gave you that medal...

20:06.430 --> 20:10.560
I said: "Let's be together forever..."

20:10.560 --> 20:12.440
I...

20:16.400 --> 20:18.110
<i>You're so stupid, Maron.</i>

20:18.110 --> 20:18.940
Huh?

20:18.940 --> 20:23.070
<i>Be together forever? You don't understand anything.</i>

20:24.610 --> 20:26.870
<i>You don't need to ask me.</i>

20:26.870 --> 20:28.950
<i>You and I will...</i>

20:28.950 --> 20:30.950
<i>...always be together!</i>

20:36.750 --> 20:38.550
<i>Thank you, Maron.</i>

20:38.550 --> 20:42.380
<i>I will always look out for you.</i>

20:42.380 --> 20:44.340
<i>Always.</i>

20:45.590 --> 20:47.760
Thank you, Maron.

20:50.430 --> 20:54.100
Thank you...

20:58.570 --> 21:00.360
In the name of God...

21:00.360 --> 21:04.320
You, a Demon, born in darkness, I seal you here!

21:04.320 --> 21:05.740
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:15.710 --> 21:17.670
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:19.460 --> 21:22.380
Ah...no chance for you today.

21:25.470 --> 21:28.970
I can't find it. Where did it go?

21:28.970 --> 21:31.810
What's wrong? Maron-chan's waiting for you.

21:31.810 --> 21:37.980
No way! I've waited for her so many times, but she's never had to wait for me!

21:38.520 --> 21:41.980
Why did you guys wait for me, knowing that you'd be late for school?

21:41.980 --> 21:43.900
You always wait for us!

21:43.900 --> 21:45.110
Yeah!

21:45.110 --> 21:46.200
It's okay for me to wait!

21:46.200 --> 21:47.990
- Why?

21:47.990 --> 21:51.540
Don't ask at such a time! Just run!

21:51.540 --> 21:54.000
Hey, wait up!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.340 --> 23:34.390
Ahh! Big trouble, big trouble!

23:34.390 --> 23:35.720
What's wrong, Minazuki?

23:35.720 --> 23:39.640
Kusakabe-san and Toudaiji-san were forced into a car by Nagoya-kun and taken away!

23:39.640 --> 23:41.730
- Who took them away?!

23:40.940 --> 23:41.730
- Nagoya-kun!

23:41.730 --> 23:43.520
- Who am I?

23:42.440 --> 23:43.520
- Nagoya-kun!

23:43.520 --> 23:45.900
- So who took them away?!

23:44.900 --> 23:45.900
- Nagoya-kun!

23:45.900 --> 23:49.780
- In conclusion... Who's in front of you?

23:47.150 --> 23:49.780
- Nagoya-kun! Huh...?

23:49.780 --> 23:53.740
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Sealed! The Proof of Fatherly Love

23:53.740 --> 23:56.080
Knock it off, stupid Pop!

23:56.080 --> 23:59.200
What?! He's not your brother?!
